nt comment-only sweep cannot edit this HCL value.\n\n## Scope\nCorrect the alarm description to state the configured 3-of-6 window and retain its sustained-versus-transient explanation. Check adjacent alarm descriptions in this file for other threshold text drift. Keep metric identity, thresholds, dimensions, actions, and missing-data behavior unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The CloudWatch alarm description states 3 of 6 five-minute periods and matches the HCL attributes.\n- [ ] A focused test detects future description/threshold drift while respecting the AWS description limit.\n- [ ] Terraform format/validate, focused alarm tests, and repository verification pass.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"714b-0b2c-a8f9-468e","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Voter error alarm description says 3 of 5 while HCL uses 3 of 6","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["d055cf7b-d1aa-4cb7-92fe-45d4ebfea33c","6a713bc7-3a72-426b-a0cf-d06db11fab5a"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1792766155385370240,"uuid":"1825b493-d23e-409a-8cc8-01f57c191745"}